  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「あの。せ、先輩。その、えっと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「すみません、先輩。いつも、ご迷惑ばかりかけちゃって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「わたし意気地なしで、でも先輩はいつもそんなわたしを助けてくれる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「感謝してるんです、せめてお礼が言いたいんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「ありがとうございます、先輩。こんなわたしに、付きあってくれて」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「できれば、ずうっと……。先輩の、そばにいたいです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「わたし、がんばります。先輩が卒業しちゃう前に、言いたいことをはっきり言える子になります。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「ねえさんや、なつみさんみたいに、強くなります」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「だから待っててくれると、嬉しいです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「……むかし、ねえさんと人魚姫の話をしたんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「わたしは人魚姫みたいに、暗い海の底でうじうじ悩んでばっかりなんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「でも、先輩に出会えました。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「わたし、海の底から飛びだして、先輩に関わりたいって思ったんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「こんなの、生まれて初めてでした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「ねえさんたちに、わたしは足をもらいました。歩くたびに、痛くて苦しくなっちゃう足です」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「でも。ゆっくりでも……一歩ずつでも、先輩に近づいていけるかも」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「わたし、弱虫だから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「よく、くじけて止まっちゃう。蹲って泣いちゃう、先輩は待ちくたびれちゃうかもしれないです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「だけど。いつか、がんばって辿りつきますから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 38,
    "dress": "old-goth-loli",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-goth-loli_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 474
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「うう。うまく言えないです、喋るの苦手……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "set_still_image",
    "id": "card/evolved/577"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「先輩、手を握ってもいいですか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆき",
    "text": "「うまく言葉がでてこないぶん、せめて触れていたいです」"
